ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286690/extras/31531a6f2f847843c743a82517d1681d.mp4?t=1746439935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each body part of the Mech has its own armor and health. Balance your equipment to keep your deck efficient and provide enough protection. When a body part is destroyed, you can\u2019t play cards attached to it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your path</h2>Choose your path on the campaign wisely, avoid fights not suitable for your current loadout. Take greater risks for better rewards, or just complete your objectives. Discover the origins of the alien AI that is corrupting the machines.<br><br>",
